sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Receiver side
    participant V as Validator
    participant E as Exporter side
    participant P as Prometheus

    R->>V: POST :8126/path (correlation C)
    V->>V: Decode, split, map
    V->>V: payloads_received_total(receiver)++
    V->>V: pending[C] = receiver item
    V->>V: pending_payloads = size(pending)
    V-->>R: Datadog-compatible ACK

    E->>V: POST :18081/exporter/name/path (correlation C)
    V->>V: Decode, split, map
    V->>V: payloads_received_total(exporter)++
    V->>V: remove pending[C]
    V->>V: full diff + policy evaluation
    V->>V: signal/attribute counters++
    V-->>E: Datadog-compatible ACK

    P->>V: GET :8888/metrics
    V-->>P: cumulative counters + pending gauge
